Package: bayescores
Title: Comprehensive Quantification of Clinical Benefit in Randomized 
    Controlled Trials using Bayesian AFT Cure Models and BayeScores
Version: 1.0
Author: Alberto Carmona Bayonas <alberto.carmonabayonas@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Alberto Carmona Bayonas <alberto.carmonabayonas@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a comprehensive decision-making framework for the holistic analysis of randomized controlled trials (RCTs). This package introduces the Bayesian Clinical Benefit Scores (BayeScores), a novel metric to quantify the magnitude of clinical benefit by accounting for both survival prolongation and cure rates. 
License: MIT + file LICENSE
